cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Mole, please cite the paper below."
title: "Mole: Detecting Insider Threats in AI Agents"
abstract: >-
  An open benchmark for detecting insider threats by AI agents in a simulated
  frontier AI lab: 150 AI-operated accounts sharing nine stateful services over
  30 workdays, with twelve MITRE-grounded threats, and monitors that rank
  accounts each day under a limited review budget.
